    "In week one, make movement and jumping playable on a simple test platform, then share a build anyone can open.",
    "In week two, build one short level with a start, a finish and a restart after falling, then share a playable build.",
    "In weeks three and four, ask two people to open and finish the level without help, fix problems that block them, and share the revised build with brief test notes."
  ],
